1
00:00:01,502 --> 00:00:05,839
(Yamanaka) Sanada just wasn't for me.NOTE Sanada.

2
00:00:05,839 --> 00:00:12,346
♬～

3
00:00:12,346 --> 00:00:14,448
(Kakizaki) Let's continue!

4
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:22,189
♬～

5
00:00:22,189 --> 00:00:24,892
(Sanada) I want to see more scenery with everyone.

6
00:00:24,892 --> 00:00:32,432
♬～

7
00:00:32,432 --> 00:00:37,337
Please enter Eternal Boys again NOTE Eternal Boys

8
00:00:40,474 --> 00:00:44,478
I'll try my best to become an idol

9
00:00:44,478 --> 00:00:46,713
thank you!

10
00:00:46,713 --> 00:00:52,753
Our debut song title is "Eternal"

11
00:00:52,753 --> 00:00:55,923
(Imagawa) Here we come! If the debut song is decided

12
00:00:55,923 --> 00:00:58,859
That's what I should do next.

13
00:00:58,859 --> 00:01:01,862
(Fukuko) I asked Ren, my breadwinner, to appear.

14
00:01:01,862 --> 00:01:04,665
I'm going to shoot the music video for "Eternal"

15
00:01:04,665 --> 00:01:06,667
Huh? (Asai) Oh

16
00:01:06,667 --> 00:01:11,338
(Ren) Well, let's have a comedy competition, shall we?

17
00:01:11,338 --> 00:01:15,008
Yes, if you can make me laugh

18
00:01:15,008 --> 00:01:17,644
MV You can come out and do it.

19
00:01:17,644 --> 00:01:20,380
You're so careless... Are you serious?

20
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:23,851
I'll do it, but is it okay?

21
00:01:23,851 --> 00:01:27,020
We're pretty funny though

22
00:01:44,037 --> 00:01:46,340
Brief Kenpo!

23
00:01:48,809 --> 00:01:50,811
Briefs!

24
00:01:53,313 --> 00:01:56,316
Huh? That's it?

25
00:01:57,751 --> 00:01:59,753
(Imagawa) You're so cocky.

26
00:01:59,753 --> 00:02:03,156
I'm a former popular child actor and your senior.

27
00:02:03,156 --> 00:02:07,628
Hey, I don't know, what are you in?

28
00:02:07,628 --> 00:02:09,963
Is it a commercial?

29
00:02:09,963 --> 00:02:13,467
Don't you know what "mellow" means?

30
00:02:13,467 --> 00:02:17,971
what? Oh, don't you kids know that?

31
00:02:17,971 --> 00:02:20,908
Huh? I don't know either, huh?

32
00:02:20,908 --> 00:02:24,244
I haven't heard of it either (Ishida).

33
00:02:24,244 --> 00:02:27,681
(Imagawa) Huh? I'm sure you've seen it before

34
00:02:29,049 --> 00:02:34,955
Mellow, refreshing, ladylike

35
00:02:39,193 --> 00:02:43,063
Hehe ha ha ha ha ha ha ha

36
00:02:43,063 --> 00:02:46,066
He's not a popular child actor at all.

37
00:02:46,066 --> 00:02:49,803
Noisy! Hahahahaha

38
00:02:49,803 --> 00:02:51,805
You laughed

39
00:03:07,855 --> 00:03:09,857
(Koba) Ima-chan...

40
00:03:11,291 --> 00:03:14,928
(Sato) Oh! Hahahaha

41
00:03:14,928 --> 00:03:17,197
(Koba) It's been a long time, Ima-chan.

42
00:03:17,197 --> 00:03:20,567
(Sato) It's been 15 years since the coming-of-age ceremony?

43
00:03:20,567 --> 00:03:22,870
(Salesperson) Thank you for waiting.

44
00:03:24,938 --> 00:03:27,241
please

45
00:03:27,241 --> 00:03:32,079
Well, let's meet for the first time in 15 years... (Everyone) Good luck!

46
00:03:37,184 --> 00:03:39,186
Do you two meet often?

47
00:03:39,186 --> 00:03:43,390
The younger children are the same age and often play together as a family.

48
00:03:43,390 --> 00:03:45,492
It's been a while since today, but yeah yeah

49
00:03:45,492 --> 00:03:48,228
Recently, I was transferred to a different department and my work is very hard.

50
00:03:48,228 --> 00:03:51,532
Hehe, what have you been up to lately?

51
00:03:51,532 --> 00:03:54,034
Ah... me?

52
00:03:55,469 --> 00:03:58,105
I'm an idol

53
00:03:58,105 --> 00:04:01,608
Huh? Idol? Amazing

54
00:04:01,608 --> 00:04:04,244
Ima-chan is really cool.

55
00:04:04,244 --> 00:04:07,981
Well, idols also have a lot of trouble behind the scenes.

56
00:04:07,981 --> 00:04:09,983
(Sato) What... what's so amazing?

57
00:04:09,983 --> 00:04:12,319
I had to learn the moves quickly.

58
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:14,721
Swing? (Imagawa) Dance

59
00:04:14,721 --> 00:04:16,823
I could dance!

60
00:04:16,823 --> 00:04:19,426
Camio, do you know that I got married? Camio?

61
00:04:19,426 --> 00:04:23,197
Look, the guy who became a police officer!

62
00:04:23,197 --> 00:04:28,135
Hey, he's finally home again. How's he doing now?

63
00:04:28,135 --> 00:04:30,871
I? I'm not

64
00:04:30,871 --> 00:04:32,873
Because he's everyone's idol

65
00:04:32,873 --> 00:04:35,309
(Koba) Kakke (Sato) Hahahaha

66
00:04:35,309 --> 00:04:39,713
I wanted to chase my dreams too, I thought I could have a child.

67
00:04:39,713 --> 00:04:42,416
You are no longer the main character in your life.

68
00:04:42,416 --> 00:04:45,252
Really, Sato-chan and Koji are elementary school students?

69
00:04:45,252 --> 00:04:47,788
That's right, I went to look at school bags just last week.

70
00:04:47,788 --> 00:04:49,990
Yes, yes, yes, in the past...

71
00:04:49,990 --> 00:04:52,125
Being a girl, I dream of being a princess...

72
00:04:52,125 --> 00:04:54,228
Please go to the toilet for a moment.

73
00:04:54,228 --> 00:04:56,430
I have to buy it for you, Dad, but I understand.

74
00:04:56,430 --> 00:04:59,032
He says he really wants it...

75
00:05:08,775 --> 00:05:12,346
(Imagawa) <<What are you doing? Me≫

76
00:05:18,352 --> 00:05:20,621
≪Is this okay? ≫

77
00:05:20,621 --> 00:05:24,625
⚟♬『Eternal』

78
00:05:24,625 --> 00:05:42,676
⚟♬～

79
00:05:49,650 --> 00:05:51,985
Doesn't it come out (Asai)?

80
00:05:51,985 --> 00:05:55,856
I don't think so (Kakizaki), but are you coming alone?

81
00:05:55,856 --> 00:06:01,094
No, I'm worried that my mother will be with me.

82
00:06:07,501 --> 00:06:12,840
Ren, what were you doing? I was worried (Ren) Not really...

83
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:16,977
It's not "special", it's already been 30 minutes.

84
00:06:16,977 --> 00:06:19,546
I mean, what happened to your mother?

85
00:06:19,546 --> 00:06:23,684
I don't know, it's Rimu's place anyway NOTE Rimu

86
00:06:23,684 --> 00:06:27,721
Ren, you're late and you don't have that attitude.

87
00:06:27,721 --> 00:06:32,159
Apologize to everyone

88
00:06:32,159 --> 00:06:35,362
Who is Rimu? I'm Ren's younger brother.

89
00:06:35,362 --> 00:06:38,932
The most popular child actor now

90
00:06:38,932 --> 00:06:41,768
It's amazing how all the siblings are popular child actors.

91
00:06:41,768 --> 00:06:44,338
(Asai) My younger brother is already selling better now.

92
00:06:44,338 --> 00:06:49,943
Child actors have short lives, sorry!

93
00:06:49,943 --> 00:06:52,646
You can't survive in this world if you do that.

94
00:06:52,646 --> 00:06:58,318
Okay, I'm quitting now, so what's the point?

95
00:07:01,188 --> 00:07:05,893
Don't cry on set, you're not a kid anymore.

96
00:07:05,893 --> 00:07:09,897
(Ren) Don't run away from the toilet.

97
00:07:10,964 --> 00:07:12,966
Ima-chan...

98
00:07:48,435 --> 00:07:51,738
(knock)

99
00:07:51,738 --> 00:07:53,740
Hey

100
00:07:57,511 --> 00:08:01,882
We can't shoot without you.

101
00:08:01,882 --> 00:08:05,519
(Ren) You can do it without me.

102
00:08:07,621 --> 00:08:10,657
I'm quitting the entertainment industry

103
00:08:15,195 --> 00:08:18,031
why?

104
00:08:18,031 --> 00:08:22,803
(Ren) I'm not a child anymore.

105
00:08:22,803 --> 00:08:26,039
Why can't the old man continue?

106
00:08:26,039 --> 00:08:30,911
It's not selling, so why don't you quit?

107
00:08:30,911 --> 00:08:33,747
If it doesn't sell, I'll keep doing what I love

108
00:08:33,747 --> 00:08:37,117
Can't you?

109
00:08:37,117 --> 00:08:41,288
(Ren) You're miserable even though you're not needed.

110
00:08:44,291 --> 00:08:46,293
miserable?

111
00:08:48,962 --> 00:08:51,164
(Ren) What about you?

112
00:08:51,164 --> 00:08:54,101
I'm saying no one likes me!

113
00:08:59,907 --> 00:09:03,844
That's right

114
00:09:03,844 --> 00:09:09,917
But what if I give up on this dream now?

115
00:09:09,917 --> 00:09:13,620
I think you'll stop liking me too.

116
00:09:16,990 --> 00:09:24,998
"No one thinks about me..." I know that for real.

117
00:09:24,998 --> 00:09:31,471
Well, at least...at least for me.

118
00:09:31,471 --> 00:09:35,542
I want to love myself

119
00:09:35,542 --> 00:09:42,583
So it's okay to be miserable

120
00:09:42,583 --> 00:09:45,052
me for me...

121
00:09:49,323 --> 00:09:51,992
(Imagawa) I want to chase my dreams

122
00:09:51,992 --> 00:09:59,533
♬～

123
00:09:59,533 --> 00:10:01,535
(sound of door opening)

124
00:10:01,535 --> 00:10:14,281
♬～

125
00:10:14,281 --> 00:10:16,283
Uncool

126
00:10:16,283 --> 00:10:24,057
♬～

127
00:10:24,057 --> 00:10:27,060
That's uncool

128
00:10:28,862 --> 00:10:32,499
(cry)

129
00:10:32,499 --> 00:10:35,435
(Imagawa) Sanayan...

130
00:10:35,435 --> 00:10:38,872
Imagawa-san is cool

131
00:10:41,175 --> 00:10:46,680
Absolutely... absolutely cool

132
00:10:48,415 --> 00:11:03,764
(cry)

133
00:11:03,764 --> 00:11:06,500
Adults cry too

134
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:11,138
♬～

135
00:11:11,138 --> 00:11:13,640
I'm sorry

136
00:11:17,177 --> 00:11:21,548
You can also come out and do the MV.

137
00:11:21,548 --> 00:11:23,951
What kind of change in state of mind?

138
00:11:27,955 --> 00:11:33,293
Mellow, refreshing, ladylike

139
00:11:33,293 --> 00:11:37,931
Haha (Imagawa) You, don't make fun of your seniors.

140
00:11:37,931 --> 00:11:42,603
I'll take a picture right away, man...

141
00:11:42,603 --> 00:11:45,239
Okay, let's do it!

142
00:11:45,239 --> 00:11:47,241
(Kakizaki) Yes.

143
00:11:47,241 --> 00:11:57,417
♬～

144
00:11:57,417 --> 00:12:00,888
I don't feel a soul. (Staff) A soul?

145
00:12:00,888 --> 00:12:02,990
(Souta) Nice to meet you, I'm Souta from GentlemenNOTE That's right.

146
00:12:03,991 --> 00:12:05,993
Did you see it?
